      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 8 years 9 months ago",
      "body": "I must say this is the right place where I was looking for help. I would like to thank the admin for making such a helpful and much-needed forum for most of the parents. I become almost difficult to work in an office if you have a small child at home. I was also looking for some home-based work after the birth of my first baby she is hardly 2 months old. I have found this forum very effective and helpful. Hopefully, I will get some home-based work through this forum. My partner is working full time but the earning is not enough to meet our needs. So really looking forward to some quick home-based work.",
